      "writtenOn": "2016-01-27T22:24:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not good REST to be able to list this here but create/update/delete with a totally different path structure. If you\u0027re creating/deleting above, where you\u0027re also listing and getting, then you don\u0027t need this. If you move the create/delete down here, then the get/list could move here as well. But we should be consistent.",
      "revId": "d52d9524d84a04230235887ec316afb8fdd3c1dd",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
